Z||000000||RiceCooker||09-08-2000||03:11 PM||||Any NFL fans in the house?<P>The Tampa Bay Buccaneers are the greatest team ever!<BR>There is no better feeling than to cheer on a tem for years, and everyone thinks they suck (well, ok they did suck) but then Tony Dungy comes in and turns things around and those guys are awesome.<BR>Mike Alstott is not human!<BR>there are a lot of guys who are big power backs and can run through people, and also a lot of shifty RB's. But how many can do both like the A-train?<P>NOBODY!<P>I just had to let everyone here know that!<P>P.S. Fieros and NFL are great accompanying hobbies. When it starts to snow, I put the car away and watch football. Then the day after the superbowl, i start working on my car projects and gettin ready for spring.<P>P.S.S. NO! it is not snowing in Canada yet!!!||||reg||6
Z||000001||frontal lobe||09-08-2000||05:56 PM||||Being in Wisconsin, of course I love the Packers--no matter how hard they make it this year.  So I'm not thrilled that the Buccaneers are good now.  I am glad for you, though, that you can enjoy this year.  I don't see the Bucs advancing to the Super Bowl because of Shaun King, but hey, at least you will have a team in the playoffs this year.<P>I do have to say that I find Mike Alstott about the most over-rated player in the NFL.  He is good for a couple of highlight runs a game but I don't see the overall production from him to justify him in the Pro Bowl.<P>I'm surprised you are so crazy about the Buccaneers and not the BEST TEAM OF ALL ORGANIZED FOOTBALL--the HAMILTON TIGERCATS!!!!||||reg||1
