Z||000010||frontal lobe||09-14-2000||01:59 AM||||Big test for your Buccaneers this week in the Silverdome--tough place to play.<P>Still love the Packers, even though this is going to be a llllonnnnngggg year.<P>RiceCooker, interesting choice of teams you hate.  Just curious why those particular teams?  Now Dallas, well, duh, that's obvious.  Who doesn't hate them?  San Francisco--the Forty Whiners, so that's a given.  Packers--obvious, because for all those years they STOMPED the Buccaneers and RULED the division (ah, the good OLD days).  The Dolphins, I assume is territorial envy.  Why the Steelers?  Because they are so cheap they could only afford to put there logo on one side of their helmets?  Enquiring minds want to know.<P>P.S.  I can't wait for the Buccaneers to have a "turn back the clock game" so they can bring out their "gay pirate" uniforms again.  Disclaimer:  if anyone on the forum is gay, I'm not picking on homosexuals.||||reg||1
