Z||000128||Fiero5||11-06-2000||09:30 PM||||I have been an open proud Bengal fan for all of these many, many years, even during all these "rebuilding" years. I wear my Bengals shirts and now that it's chilly my Bengal windbreaker (which Bengal stuff is hard to get in New England by the way) with pride. I get the insults and the jabbing, but I think back at the die hard Cowboy fans those many years before the Cowboys got back on track a few years ago. I know that like all teams, at some point it will click again, and I can say proudly that I wasn't a closet fan. <BR> <BR>Hey, who can help me get some more Bengal merchandise? I would love to have a winter Bengal jacket and other cool stuff. Catalogs like JC Penney only carry stuff for those teams who were successful or popular the last few years. And that unfortunatly leaves out the Bengals right now  :o(<P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                                                         <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/Colosseum/Rink/2492/bengallogo.gif"> ||||reg||1
