Z||000172||RiceCooker||11-27-2000||01:44 PM||||Oh, yeah<BR>I'm sure everyone still remembers 1998<P>Gary *cough*(CHOKE)*cough* Anderson<P><BR>Who watched the Bucs game?<BR>I don't know who is more unbelievable John Lynch or Derrick Brooks.<BR>Lynch separates his shoulder last week but still comes out popping people.<BR>Brooks, well, the guy is a dot com. (he's at the end of everything.<BR>He had 19 tackles but you had to see them. One he hit Rob Johnson trying to scramble in the open field and pretty much folded him in half. He was taken down backs in the backfield too. The one that really impressed me is when he got to Johnson just before he shovelled it to Bryson. Johnson lay motionless on the field but Brooks gets up and runs 25 yards back upfield to tackle Shawn Bryson who was dodging tackles. It was like there were two #55's on the field all day!!!<P>Everyone should go to NFL.com and vote for Derrick Brooks in the Pro Bowl right now<BR>And while you're there, Warren Sapp, Marcus Jones, John Lynch, Ronde Barber, and Keyshawn Johnson.<P><BR>Just kidding, not Keyshawn.||||reg||12
