Z||000195||RiceCooker||12-16-2000||01:55 PM||||Monday will be REVENGE!!!<P>St. Louis Rams @ Tampa Bay Buccaneers<P><BR>Remember last years NFC championship game?<BR>The bucs were down by five late in the game and driving. They were at the St. Louis 25 or so and completed a pass to Reidel Anthony on a third a long for a first down. After replay, they overruled the catch because the ball hit the ground even though Anthony clearly had possesion. During the offseason they even changed the rule on that type of play because of it.<BR>Would the bucs have scored and gone on to the Super Bowl instead of the Rams? We will never know. <BR>What we do know is the winner of Monday nights game will be in the playoffs while the other will be sweating. <P>I get shivers just thinkin about it. I'd much rather be playing in a game like this than be watching it!||||reg||8
