Z||000206||mrfixit58||12-20-2000||11:00 AM||||WAAAAHOOOO!!! Bucs 38 - Rams 35<P>I had to wait until I caught up on my sleep before I could post to this thread. The game didn't end until two and a half hous past my usual bed time (I'm gettin old  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ). What a game. This was truly one of the best PRO games I've ever seen. With that backwards lateral, the label of "Oh, Those Tricky Buccaneers!" is back... at least for a week.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I hope the Bucs can shake this one quickly and start to really concentrate on the Packers. I really would like to see them shake that "40º or below - can't win" label.<P>The Vikes' may be in a little trouble. I read where Culpepper has a really bad ankle and Robert Smith has a bad knee. Both will most likey play but it may give the advantage to the Colts. Sorry Jimmy but, if the Vikes' lose and the Bucs win, the Bucs get the NFC Central title and a bye week in the playoffs. So... Go Colts!<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
