Z||000208||RiceCooker||12-20-2000||12:22 PM||||If the Lions make the playoffs, they would be one of the worst teams to make the post season in recent years. Come on guys, think how bad the Lions actually are. They have a decent offensive line and James Stewart is good. Their quarterback stinks and their defence is overrated. IF things had gone a bit different this team could easily be 6-9.<P>But that's OK, I hope the Bucs play them in the playoffs - and you can quote me on that. <P>Don't forget bucs fans, not only are they 0-18 when the temp is below 40 but Favre is 26-0 when it's under 34 at Lambeau or something like that.<BR>If they can overcome that, they can do anything. <P>I was goin nuts the entire Bucs Rams game but the best was when Sapp pasted Warner.<P>Warner looks left, looks rights, steps to his left, then .......BANG!!! 300lbs. right into his chest!<P>Has anyone ever won the defensive MVP two years in a row? I think Sapp has a good chance. Tell me folks, is he not the fastest 300lb man on planet or what?||||reg||13
