Z||000240||Black88GT||01-07-2001||04:36 PM||||Another exciting one between the Titans and Ravens.  To be honest, I wasn't sure who was going to win, our offense is too inconsistent.  <P>Statistically, they (titans) had a better game.  McNair played good and George managed to get some decent rushing yards.  Dilfer didnt play too good, but atleast he didn't give up the big interception/TD return like last game.  Del Shanko played like he always does, haha...<P>The matchup between George a Ray Lewis was awesome.  Two of the best in football going at it.  I think Ray won, especially with that interception/TD return at the end, where he stole it from George.  <P>Oakland, here we come...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fieropage/bal.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<p>[This message has been edited by Black88GT (edited 01-07-2001).]||||reg||1
