Z||000247||Black88GT||01-08-2001||05:28 PM||||Well coach of the year because he turned this team around big time.  Remember, he was the offensive coordinator for the super bowl champion Vikings before he became head coach, trust me he knows his offense.  When your playing with a QB like Banks, there isn't much you can do.  Luckily he smartened up and started Dilfer, not that much better but atleast better then Banks.  Hopefully the rookie Retman we have will grow into a good QB, he is our only hope...<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
