Z||000303||Black88GT||01-19-2001||08:55 PM||||They don't have too much invested in Trent Dilfer!! LOL.  <P>It just seems they protect the QB too much.  Thats why I love Doug Flutie so much, while he might slide when he runs (thats just being smart) when he takes a big hit and people ask him about it, he just says "hey thats football"<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
